# Royal Elementor Addons – Modal popups JS

Minify `assets/js/modal-popups.min.js` from the plugin folder, the same way as `npm run build:frontend-safe`. Do not write a backup.

- In the plugin directory, run `npm run build:modal-popups-local`.
- That rewrites `assets/js/modal-popups.min.js` in the folder where you run it. It does not write a backup and it does not touch the other site. Full steps are in `FRONTEND-MINIFYING.md`.
